WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.055
Somewhere in your customer data, your best buyers have gone quiet.

00:04.200 --> 00:08.229
GrowthOS is an AI agent watching your customer data.

00:08.300 --> 00:14.117
It finds seventy-six dormant VIPs, worth one point one lakh rupees, to win back.

00:14.300 --> 00:17.811
Then it drafts the WhatsApp, email, or SMS campaign.

00:18.300 --> 00:21.099
You approve. It sends, and tracks what converts.

00:22.400 --> 00:25.950
GrowthOS. Find the revenue you're losing, and win it back.
